 7-Eleven) near a subway station. The card costs ₩2,500 and you load credit onto it. Tap in, tap out."}],["$","h2","8",{"className":"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-8 mb-3","children":"Key Lines"}],["$","li","10",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Line 2 (Green Circle)"}]," — ","The most useful line. Loops through Hongdae, Gangnam, Jamsil and most major districts."]}],["$","li","11",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Line 6 (Brown)"}]," — ","Runs through Itaewon and Hannam."]}],["$","li","12",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Line 3 (Orange)"}]," — ","Connects to Gyeongbokgung and Bukhansan."]}],["$","li","13",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Line 4 (Blue)"}]," — ","Myeongdong and the university district."]}],["$","h2","15",{"className":"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-8 mb-3","children":"Apps to Download"}],["$","li","17",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Naver Map"}]," — ","Better than Google Maps in Korea. Accurate subway directions."]}],["$","li","18",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"KakaoMap"}]," — ","The local alternative. Both work well."]}],["$","li","19",{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground ml-4 mb-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Subway Korea"}]," — ","Dedicated metro app with transfer times."]}],["$","h2","21",{"classN